# Build artifacts and deps — never copy these into an image build context.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
# Docker's ignore matching, unlike .gitignore, does not recurse a bare pattern
# into subdirectories, so api/dist (api/package.json's `build` script output,
# unused by Dockerfile.api which runs from source) needs its own line, same as
# node_modules below.
**/dist
dist-ssr
.output
.vinxi
.nitro
.tanstack
.wrangler

# Foundry build artifacts (BE-25a). Regenerated by `forge build`.
contracts/out
contracts/cache
contracts/broadcast
contracts/script/local/backup-*.dump

# VCS and local
.git
.gitignore
*.log
.DS_Store
.mainnet-handoff

# Env files. Never bake secrets into an image.
#
# The bare patterns only matched the repo root: api/.env (real secrets, since
# this is a dev checkout) survived into the build context and would have been
# copied straight into the api image by `COPY api ./api`. Same non-recursion
# gotcha as node_modules and dist above, just far higher stakes (global do-not
# 18), so every level gets the "**/" form too.
.env
**/.env
.env.*
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# Specs and docs are not needed at runtime.
spec
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
